OL,3,GNEWSAPipe collapses under canal hit by
OL,4,Amajor breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pipe that carries water beneath a
OL,7,Fstretch of the canal in Shropshire has
OL,8,Fcollapsed, less than 10 miles away from
OL,9,Fthe site of a major canal collapse in
OL,10,FDecember 2025.
OL,12,FThe Canal and River Trust (CRT) said it
OL,13,Fwas responding to an incident on the
OL,14,FLlangollen Canal at Hampton Bank
OL,15,Ffollowing the collapse of the culvert.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
