OL,3,GNEWSAPipe collapses under canal hit by
OL,4,Amajor breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA CRT spokesperson said its team along
OL,7,Fwith infrastructure partner, Kier, were
OL,8,Fon site and had closed the affected
OL,9,Fsection of canal. The trust added it
OL,10,Fwas carrying out emergency works to
OL,11,Fslow the flow of water into a
OL,12,Fneighbouring field.
OL,14,FAccording to CRT, two nearby properties
OL,15,Fhave also been affected by flooding.
